          "text": "{\"stories\":[{\"id\":\"s000014\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The repair succeeds and the kite flies, ending on a clear image, though the boat-sail remark is unexplained.\",\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000028\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The repair succeeds and the kite flies, ending on a clear image, though the boat-sail remark is unexplained.\",\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000058\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":6,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The torn kite is repurposed into a working boat sail, with a concrete outcome; the initial wish to repair it is left behind.\",\"group_id\":1},{\"id\":\"s000023\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":6,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The torn kite is repurposed into a working boat sail, with a concrete outcome; the initial wish to repair it is left behind.\",\"group_id\":1},{\"id\":\"s000036\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":6,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":7,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The failed tape repair gives the child a reason to turn the kite into a sail, and the boat's voyage provides a satisfying ending.\",\"group_id\":2},{\"id\":\"s000017\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The repaired kite flies successfully, but the boat-sail suggestion remains a distracting loose thread.\",\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000053\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":6,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The torn kite is repurposed into a working boat sail, with a concrete outcome; the initial wish to repair it is left behind.\",\"group_id\":1},{\"id\":\"s000021\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":6,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":7,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"When the tape repair fails, the child redirects the torn kite into a sail, and the boat's voyage completes the turn.\",\"group_id\":2},{\"id\":\"s000034\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":6,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The child redirects the torn kite into a boat sail, and the sailing boat supplies a clear ending, though the original goal is dropped.\",\"group_id\":1},{\"id\":\"s000048\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":6,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The child makes a boat sail from the torn kite and succeeds, though the opening wish to repair the kite is not resolved.\",\"group_id\":1},{\"id\":\"s000002\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":6,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The torn kite becomes a sail that carries the boat across the pond, a clear outcome despite the abandoned kite-flying goal.\",\"group_id\":1},{\"id\":\"s000057\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":6,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The torn kite becomes a sail that carries the boat across the pond, a clear outcome despite the abandoned kite-flying goal.\",\"group_id\":1}],\"diversity\":{\"premise\":2,\"causal_path\":3,\"ending\":3,\"language\":2,\"overall\":3},\"diversity_evidence\":\"All stories center on a torn kite and the choice between repairing it or using it as a boat sail. The repaired-and-flown versions (s000014, s000017, s000028) share one outcome; direct repurposing stories (s000002, s000023, s000034, s000048, s000053, s000057, s000058) share another; s000021 and s000036 add the same failed-repair detour before repurposing. Names and small dialogue variations do not create distinct plots.\",\"plot_groups\":[{\"group_id\":0,\"summary\":\"The child tapes the torn kite and successfully flies it, while the boat-sail suggestion is not pursued.\"},{\"group_id\":1,\"summary\":\"The child abandons kite repair and repurposes the torn kite as a boat sail, which carries the boat across the pond.\"},{\"group_id\":2,\"summary\":\"The child tries to tape the kite, it tears again, and the child repurposes it as a boat sail that carries the boat across the pond.\"}] }",
